(sha256 `{{ ds.sha256[:16] }}`), seed {{ cfg.seed }}.

## Data and protocol

- {{ ds.n_rows_raw }} images; {{ ds.n_dropped_implausible_age }} rows with an implausible age (> {{ cfg.max_age }}) removed, leaving {{ ds.n_rows }} images of {{ ds.n_patients }} patients.
- Label: 1 = at least one finding, 0 = "No Finding" (positive rate {{ ds.positive_rate | pct }}).
- Split by **patient**, so no patient contributes images to two splits. Thresholds of the post-processing mitigations are tuned on the validation patients; every number below is measured on the test patients, with predictions = score >= {{ cfg.threshold }} unless stated otherwise.
